COMPOUND     -$RARHO    RADIUM    -$GRHO    CARBON   -$CLRHO  CHLORINERACL2
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE   BLKHOLE
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM    VACREG
ASSIGNMA      AL6061    ALCASE
ASSIGNMA       WATER       WAT
ASSIGNMA    TANTALUM     TAWIN
ASSIGNMA       CUMIX    CUBACK
ASSIGNMA       WATER      COOL
ASSIGNMA       RACL2       TGT
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM     DET01    OUTDET         1
* Inventory physics retained; explicit pointwise library selection.
PHYSICS            3                                                  EVAPORAT
PHYSICS            1                                                  COALESCE
LOW-PWXS                          $NTEMP                              JEFF-3.3
* Thermal binding at the room-temperature NTEMP assumption.
* Water: explicit H-1 binding; graphite: carbon additive retains its lattice.
LOW-PWXS       10010   h_water    $NTEMP  HYDROGEN                    JEFF-3.3
LOW-PWXS              graphite    $NTEMP    CARBON                    JEFF-3.3
* 1 keV photons by default; 100 keV electron kinetic cutoff.
EMFCUT        -$ECUT     $GCUT              VACREG       TGT
EMFCUT        -$ECUT     $GCUT               DET01    OUTDET
EMFCUT        -$ECUT     $GCUT         1  HYDROGEN     RACL2          PROD-CUT
#if PHNUC
PHOTONUC           1                      HYDROGEN     RACL2
#endif
RADDECAY           1         1         3
* Durations in seconds; singly charged proton beam intensity in p/s.
IRRPROFI       $IRRT     $RATE
DCYTIMES           0      3600      7200     10800     14400     18000
